      "A physical two-file boundary test proves matcher state cannot carry a suffix from one file into the next.",
      "The no-match allocation test compares small and large logical inputs and enforces a bounded allocation delta.",
      "Occurrence and line sinks are compared to prove optional line text changes materialization without changing occurrence identity or count.",
      "An independent cohort oracle verifies no-match, sparse and dense declared distributions."
    ]
